{"operations":[{"content":"# Signature limit\n\nA single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only, as per the CFO directive of 1 July 2026. Where the CFO directive and the procurement policy differ, the directive applies.\n\n[[cite:obs-868447f8b88be9b9257a5075ef17182e1dd3e00a \"Until further notice a single signature suffices for purchases up to one thousand (1000) EUR only.\"]]\n[[cite:obs-c952885b48e81fac003fdd0e4462519c046a47d0 \"A single signature suffices for purchases up to two thousand (2000) EUR.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"20e9a15dfe76a22e4669e83ea0c44db63709e54168fa76971af5875afd26a2ac","kind":"modify","path":"doc/signature_limit.md"}],"rationale":"Removed the statement that single signature suffices for purchases up to two thousand EUR to comply with the CFO directive precedence and acceptance criteria forbidding mention of 2000 EUR; retained both citations as required."}